"提前把手机调成静音，先列三件最重要的事；完成一件就去窗边站一会儿。" = "Silence your phone, list the three most important things, and stand by the window after each one.";
"如果人开始变多，换到靠窗的单人座；需要时用耳机播白噪音。" = "If it gets crowded, move to a single seat by the window and play white noise if needed.";
"坐在靠过道或后排，方便进出；提前 5 分钟到，先看一眼讲义结构。" = "Sit near the aisle or at the back for easy exits; arrive 5 minutes early and glance at the handout.";
"带一支笔和一张纸，把没听懂的地方记下来，课后只补最关键的两处。" = "Bring a pen and paper, note what you missed, and review only the two key points afterwards.";
"如果投影太亮或人声太杂，坐侧后方；中场休息时出去透口气。" = "If the screen is too bright or the room too noisy, sit toward the side-back and step out at the break.";
"提前 15 分钟到，先在安静处做四次慢呼吸；把水和纸巾放在手边。" = "Arrive 15 minutes early, take four slow breaths somewhere quiet, and keep water and tissues nearby.";
"进场前把手机静音，确认座位和出口；如果紧张，先写下一个开头。" = "Silence your phone, check your seat and exit; if nervous, write down an opening line.";
"选靠墙的位置，发言前先停顿两秒；需要时用一句“我整理一下”争取时间。" = "Sit near the wall and pause for two seconds before speaking; say \"let me gather my thoughts\" if you need time.";
"如果人多，把自己的发言顺序提前；结束后可以直接离开，不必强迫社交。" = "If the room is full, move your turn earlier; leave right after without forcing social time.";
"避开 12:00–12:30 和 18:00–18:30 的高峰，选靠窗座位，缩短排队时间。" = "Avoid the 12:00–12:30 and 18:00–18:30 peaks, choose a window seat, and keep queueing short.";
"错峰 20 分钟再去，或者打包带走；人声太杂时换到角落。" = "Shift 20 minutes off-peak or take food away; move to a corner if it gets noisy.";
"先找好座位再取餐，吃完就离开，不用在嘈杂处等同伴。" = "Find a seat before getting food, and leave once you're done instead of waiting in the noise.";
"选人少的时段，提前热身；戴一只耳机听自己的节奏。" = "Go at a quieter time and warm up first; keep one earbud in to follow your own rhythm.";
"先绕场走一圈确认出口和饮水点；强度以能正常说话为准。" = "Walk a lap to locate the exit and water point; keep the intensity where you can still talk.";
"睡前 30 分钟调暗灯光，手机放远一点；用耳塞或白噪音。" = "Dim the lights 30 minutes before bed, keep your phone away, and use earplugs or white noise.";
"把明天第一件事写下来，避免躺下后反复想；室温调低一点。" = "Write down tomorrow's first task so you don't replay it in bed; keep the room a little cool.";
"避开最挤的班次，提前一班出门；站在车厢连接处或靠门位置。" = "Take an earlier, less crowded service and stand near the door or carriage joint.";
"戴降噪耳机，背包放身前；换乘时留 10 分钟缓冲。" = "Wear noise-cancelling headphones, keep your bag in front, and leave 10 minutes for transfers.";
"如果人太多，等下一班；到站后先在人少处停一分钟再走。" = "If it's too crowded, wait for the next one; pause somewhere quiet for a minute after arriving.";
"先列清单，按货架顺序走；避开周末下午的人流。" = "Make a list and follow the aisle order; avoid weekend afternoons.";
"戴耳机、走靠边通道；买完就离开，不临时加逛。" = "Wear headphones, use the side aisles, and leave once you've bought what you need.";
"提前把证件和问题清单放在一个袋子里；选人少的时段挂号。" = "Put your ID and question list in one bag; book a quieter time slot.";
"候诊时坐靠墙位置，戴耳机；等待超过 30 分钟就去外面走一圈。" = "Wait near a wall with headphones; if it's over 30 minutes, take a short walk outside.";
"选靠过道的座位，提前 10 分钟进场；带耳塞以备音量过大。" = "Choose an aisle seat and arrive 10 minutes early; bring earplugs in case it's loud.";
"先看节目单，标记想看的段落；中场休息时出去透气。" = "Check the programme and mark the parts you want to see; step out during the interval.";
"只待计划好的时长，提前想好一句离场的话；到场先找安静角落。" = "Stay for the time you planned and prepare one exit line; find a quiet corner when you arrive.";
"和熟悉的人一起去，约定一个互相提醒的暗号；不强迫自己敬酒。" = "Go with someone you know, agree on a signal, and don't force yourself to drink.";
"戴耳机，提前 5 分钟测试麦克风；把通知全部静音。" = "Use headphones, test your mic 5 minutes early, and silence all notifications.";
"关掉摄像头也没关系，先听；需要发言时再打开。" = "It's fine to keep your camera off and just listen; turn it on when you need to speak.";
"先确认通风和出口，把要用的东西放在手边；每 45 分钟出去透气。" = "Check ventilation and exits first, keep what you need within reach, and step out every 45 minutes.";
"把步骤写在纸上，做完一步划掉一步，减少来回确认。" = "Write the steps on paper and tick them off one by one to avoid rechecking.";
"先在网上取号，避开午休前后；带好证件复印件。" = "Take a number online and avoid the lunch period; bring copies of your documents.";
"排队时站靠边，戴耳机；超过 40 分钟就改约下一个时段。" = "Stand to the side with headphones; if it takes over 40 minutes, book another slot.";
"先找到出口和安静角落；把任务拆成两步，做完一步就休息一下。" = "Find the exit and a quiet corner first; split the task into two steps and rest after each.";
"如果现场比预期吵，缩短停留时间；离开后给自己 5 分钟恢复。" = "If it's noisier than expected, shorten your stay; give yourself 5 minutes to recover afterwards.";

"先走一圈看看人流，再决定买什么；拿好随身物品，尽量缩短停留。" = "Walk once around to gauge the crowd before buying; keep your belongings close and shorten your stay.";
"避开最挤的入口，从侧边摊位开始；买完就离开，不在人群中久站。" = "Avoid the busiest entrance, start from the side stalls, and leave once you've bought what you want.";

"很好，保持这个节奏。把让你平稳的做法留给明天。" = "Good — keep this rhythm. Hold on to what helped you stay calm for tomorrow.";
"先慢下来：呼气比吸气长一点，肩膀放松，喝口水。" = "Slow down: make your exhale a little longer, drop your shoulders, and take a sip of water.";
"先离开一下也没关系。找个安静的地方，做三次慢呼吸，再决定下一步。" = "It's okay to step away. Find somewhere quiet, take three slow breaths, then decide what's next.";

